## 思路

转化为**子集和**问题:设负数部分和为 `neg`,则 `正数和 - neg = target`,且 `正数和 + neg = sum`,得 `neg = (sum - target)/2`。问题变为「选若干数凑成 `neg` 的方案数」,用 0/1 背包计数。

## 参考代码

```js
function findTargetSumWays(nums, target) {
  const sum = nums.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0);
  const diff = sum - target;
  if (diff < 0 || diff % 2 !== 0) return 0;
  const neg = diff / 2;
  const dp = new Array(neg + 1).fill(0);
  dp[0] = 1;
  for (const n of nums) {
    for (let j = neg; j >= n; j--) {
      dp[j] += dp[j - n];
    }
  }
  return dp[neg];
}
```

## 复杂度

- 时间:O(n * (sum-target)/2)
- 空间:O((sum-target)/2)
